silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_17_commutative_diagrams_as_governance_concrete_anchor_1_square_21#commutingsquare21 silm:hasLongDescription "The CommutingSquare21 is a paper-21 typed-English commuting square. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'square_21', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
